{
  "name": "Real Estate - AI Data Research & Content Generation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "setup-guide",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-200, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🛠️ Setup Guide\n\n## 📄 Overview\nThis workflow fetches data from external URLs, extracts information using AI, performs research with web search tools, generates analysis, and outputs results to Google Sheets and Google Docs.\n\n## 🔑 Required Credentials\n- **OpenAI**: API key for data extraction and content generation\n- **Google Sheets**: OAuth2 for logging analysis data\n- **Google Docs**: OAuth2 for updating documents\n- **SerpAPI**: API key for web search tool (optional)\n\n## ⚙️ Configuration Steps\n1. Connect all required credentials\n2. Update **Fetch External Data** node with your target URL\n3. Configure **Google Sheets** node with your spreadsheet ID and sheet name\n4. Configure **Google Docs** node with your document ID\n5. Set schedule trigger timing (default: every hour)\n6. Customize AI prompts as needed for your use case\n\n## 📋 Resources to Create\n- [🔗 Create Google Sheet](https://sheets.new) - Create a sheet with columns: Timestamp, Title, Summary, Category, Source\n- Create a Google Doc for AI analysis output\n\n## 🧪 Testing\n1. Use Manual Trigger to test\n2. Check Google Sheets/Docs for output\n3. Review execution logs for AI responses",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 2
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "section-triggers",
